{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "顺序写反了",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 62.36,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO，被提走了约 360 万 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2016 年 6 月，以太坊上的 The DAO，被提走了约 360 万 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 1.692,
   "speechEnd": 7.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "按事发时的价格，约 6000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按事发时的价格，约 6000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.9,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 7.9,
   "speechEnd": 11.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "合约没有被破解。",
   "spoken": "合约没有被破解。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.04,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 12.04,
   "speechEnd": 14.037
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "它只是把两行代码的顺序，写反了。",
   "spoken": "它只是把两航代码的顺序，写反了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 14.42,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 14.42,
   "speechEnd": 17.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 18.0,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 18.0,
   "speechEnd": 18.801
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "一个银行合约，金库里有 10 个 ETH。你在里面的余额，是 1 个。",
   "spoken": "一个银航合约，金库里有 10 个 ETH。你在里面的余额，是 1 个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 19.26,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 19.355,
   "speechEnd": 25.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "你只调用一次取款函数，最多能取走多少？",
   "spoken": "你只掉用一次取款函数，最多能取走多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 26.2,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 26.293,
   "speechEnd": 29.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "答案是，全部 10 个。",
   "spoken": "答案是，全部 10 个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 30.46,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 30.555,
   "speechEnd": 32.85
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "前提有两个：银行先转账、后清零。而你，是一个合约。",
   "spoken": "前提有两个：银航先转账、后清零。而你，是一个合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 33.32,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 33.32,
   "speechEnd": 38.945
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "你每收到一笔钱，就在收款的那一刻，再调用一次取款。",
   "spoken": "你每收到一笔钱，就在收款的那一刻，再掉用一次取款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 39.38,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 39.474,
   "speechEnd": 43.541
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "账本清零，要等到所有嵌套调用都返回之后。",
   "spoken": "账本清零，要等到所有嵌套掉用都返回之后。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 44.0,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 44.0,
   "speechEnd": 47.757
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "这就是重入。最古老，也最常复发的合约漏洞。",
   "spoken": "这就是虫入。最古老，也最常复发的合约漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 48.22,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 48.313,
   "speechEnd": 52.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "这一集讲三件事：控制权在哪里交出去，重入有哪几种，怎样把顺序写对。",
   "spoken": "这一集讲三件事：控制权在哪里交出去，虫入有哪几种，怎样把顺序写对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 53.32,
   "dur": 7.84,
   "speechStart": 53.418,
   "speechEnd": 60.981
  }
 ],
